WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
Many people receiving the report will still want to download and

2
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.960
keep the files for their own records.

3
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.880
That's why Quickler lets them download a PDF, a Word document,

4
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.880
Excel, a CSV or even a web version.

5
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.020
You can also download all of your own records at any time.
